# Built cockpit dashes ARE committed, unlike most build output: Vercel deploys
# from git, so a gitignored dash means every visitor silently falls back to the
# procedural one. That is affordable now only because the cut settled — frustum
# clipping and 512 px textures took it from 68 MB to 17 MB. Rebuild with:
#   node tools/build-cockpit.mjs <donor.glb> --out volvo-s90 --tex 512
# Keep an eye on history weight if the cut is re-tuned often: binaries do not
# delta, so each rebuild adds another full copy permanently.
